OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker feared 'conspiracy
OL,4,Aby devil'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA knifeman accused of trying to kill
OL,7,Fpassengers on a moving train had a
OL,8,Fdelusional belief his life was at risk
OL,9,Fbecause of a "conspiracy by the devil",
OL,10,Fa court has heard.
OL,12,FAnthony Williams denies 10 counts of
OL,13,Fattempted murder on a Doncaster to
OL,14,FLondon King's Cross service which had
OL,15,Fto make an unscheduled stop at
OL,16,FHuntingdon in Cambridgeshire on 1
OL,17,FNovember last year.
OL,19,FCambridge Crown Court heard Dr Bernard
OL,20,FChin, a consultant forensic
OL,21,Fpsychiatrist instructed by the defence,
OL,22,Fdiagnosed Williams with schizophrenia.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
